id: advanced-learner
name: Advanced Learner
talentCategory: technique
prerequisites: Quick Learner
description: >
  Your ability to quickly grasp techniques is exceptionally versatile, allowing you to learn more types of techniques.
text: >
  Advanced Learner: Your ability to quickly grasp techniques is exceptionally versatile, allowing you to learn more types of techniques.
  –Prerequisites: Quick Learner
  (1)-[Passive]: Reduce the Technique Point Cost of any Copied Technique that would be gained at the end of a Combat Encounter by 3.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If a Character uses a Unique Ability that you meet the Prerequisites of, you may declare that Unique Ability is a Copied Technique. Gain access to it until the end of the Combat Encounter.

---

[passive]
# (1) Kept through Quick Learner (4) as the Encounter ends: its TP Cost 3 lower - a Technique's Free TP, a Unique Ability's
# change (combat.mjs).
allow advancedLearner.tpOff;
# (2) A Unique Ability used by anyone in a Combat Encounter: "Copy" offered on its card, once an Encounter - its Prerequisites
# the table's - a Copied Technique as Quick Learner's are, held to their number (chat.mjs offerUniqueCopies).
allow advancedLearner.copyUnique;
